  m_Name: Magical Computing Device
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Title: Magical Computing Device
  Parent: Miscellaneous
  RelativePath: \Root\Miscellaneous
  IsFolder: 0
  CreateFolder: 0
  Content: "The general term for computing devices that rely on magical signals in
    addition to electrical signals. Pioneered by |Ostanes| through their research
    on the magical properties of the flying city of |Agartha|. \n\nUse of the term
    \"magic\" is debated for its lack of technical specificity."
